igns it. The"] [140 1 "// pre-master secret is then calculated using ECDH. The signature may"] [141 1 "// be ECDSA, Ed25519 or RSA."] [146 2 "// ckx and preMasterSecret are generated in processServerKeyExchange"] [147 2 "// and returned in generateClientKeyExchange."] [151 2 "// curveID, signatureAlgorithm, and key are set by processServerKeyExchange"] [152 2 "// and generateServerKeyExchange."] [179 2 "// See RFC 4492, Section 5.4."] [182 27 "// named curve"] [204 20 "// ensure godebug is initialized"] [275 23 "// named curve"] [348 20 "// ensure godebug is initialized"] [383 1 "// generateECDHEKey returns a PrivateKey that implements Diffie-Hellman"] [384 1 "// according to RFC 8446, Section 4.2.8.2."]] :go/pos {:name [5 9] :package [5 1]} :go/semis [[169 41] [312 41] [355 84] [367 90]]} (go/file "key_agreement.go" :imports [


